cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ToothNotation, please cite it as below."
title: "ToothNotation: conversion between dental tooth-numbering systems"
abstract: "A dependency-free Python library, CLI, and interactive React odontogram for converting between FDI (ISO 3950), Universal, and Palmer dental tooth-numbering systems, using FDI as a canonical representation and verified by exhaustive round-trip tests (293 tests)."
type: software
